# Fast capture from the command line, then today's entries.
Output docs/images/capture.gif
Set Height 440

Type `holocron add "Fixed S3 bucket policy +aws #security"`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type `holocron add "Decision: keep weekly deploy windows +infra" --mark staff`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "holocron today"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
